                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9d8fa4f3-4676-3ae4-a934-5fcff80ae153",
                        "entry_id": "c508e311-c445-3e4a-979c-abd88c74dd21",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Having no (or very little) money."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "1a73d6da-e458-4187-ae68-82b061f94fed",
                                "sense_id": "9d8fa4f3-4676-3ae4-a934-5fcff80ae153",
                                "text": "The result, say the few moneyless militants, is a divided national Indian leadership populated by Uncle Tomahawks, or “apples,” red on the outside, white on the inside."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "08757146-c48b-44bc-8118-6a5072dfbb7c",
                                "sense_id": "9d8fa4f3-4676-3ae4-a934-5fcff80ae153",
                                "text": "\"There's a lot of times I wished I would have died because I was pathetic,\" [Stewart] says matter of factly. \"I guess I started digging a hole for myself and it got so bad I got homeless, moneyless, friendless. I just started covering myself up instead of climbing out of the hole.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e75c8af1-e460-3297-a82c-42ac8b2129ea",
                        "entry_id": "c508e311-c445-3e4a-979c-abd88c74dd21",
                        "glosses": [
                            "That does not use money as a means of exchange."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "58e577a8-75c3-47c8-acb5-74c67e73de28",
                                "sense_id": "e75c8af1-e460-3297-a82c-42ac8b2129ea",
                                "text": "Near-synonym: nonmoney"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "612bd087-e432-468e-af4b-dae69ec9fe6c",
                                "sense_id": "e75c8af1-e460-3297-a82c-42ac8b2129ea",
                                "text": "In eras when trade was largely by barter and taxes were usually paid in kind, moneyless transactions could constitute a large percentage of a national economy."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
